### Academic & Third-Party Notice
WEGOTCHU is an academic research and startup prototype developed for personal safety risk estimation and proactive decision support. Any third-party datasets, model weights, external libraries, and dependencies referenced or integrated into this repository remain subject to their respective original licenses and data-use agreements.
